  "content": "\n\n<center>\n\n<img src=\"https://ewanhowell.com/assets/images/resourcepacks/better-bows/logo.webp?rnd=0.04231423571090187\" width=\"519\" alt=\"Better Bows 標誌\"><br>\n\n## 弓系改良資源包！\n<br>\n\n[在我的網站上查看此資源包！](https://ewanhowell.com/resourcepacks/better-bows)\n<br><br>\n\n<iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/WujjBzwk00g \" width=\"600\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe><br><br><br>\n\n此資源包重新設計了弓與弩，讓射出的箭矢呈現 3D 效果，就像在遊戲世界中看到的一樣！\n\n弩也支援顯示 3D 煙花火箭、光靈箭與塗藥箭！\n\n裝備多重射擊時，你會在弩中同時看到三支箭！\n<br><br><br>\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/IPRL7R5J/images/afd710a206d0869ca30b37322dbc116b3c0cbfbd.png\" width=\"600\" alt=\"弓\"><br><br>\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/IPRL7R5J/images/485c137686ff93cc3f782aaf6245267592db1231.png\" width=\"600\" alt=\"弩\"><br><br>\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/IPRL7R5J/images/dda80fc516e46a2f4084b6121cb6db52abc9b1d3.png\" width=\"600\" alt=\"瞄準中的弓\"><br><br>\n\n⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯\n\n[<img src=\"https://ewanhowell.com/assets/images/icons/discord.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"> \n<br>\n<u>加入我的 Discord 伺服器！</u>]( https://discord.ewanhowell.com/)\n<br><br>\n[<img src=\"https://ewanhowell.com/assets/images/icons/discord.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"> \n<br>\n<u>加入資源包開發 Discord 伺服器！</u>]( https://resourcepacks.ewanhowell.com/)\n<br><br>\n[<img src=\"https://ewanhowell.com/assets/images/icons/youtube.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"> \n<br>\n<u>在 YouTube 上訂閱！</u>]( https://www.youtube.com/@EwanHowell)\n<br><br>\n[<img src=\"https://ewanhowell.com/assets/images/icons/twitter.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"> \n<br>\n<u>在 Twitter 上追蹤我！</u>]( https://twitter.com/ewanhowell5195)\n<br><br>\n[<img src=\"https://ewanhowell.com/assets/images/icons/ko-fi.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"> \n<br>\n<u>在 Ko-fi 上支持我！</u>]( https://ko-fi.com/ewanhowell)\n</center>",
